# The bulk of design-system/ (JSX, components, examples) is not needed in the
# image — but cmd/web imports the designfs package, which //go:embed's the
# view-layer artifacts into the binary, so those specific paths MUST stay in the
# build context or `go build ./cmd/web` fails with "no required module provides
# package .../design-system".
design-system
!design-system/designfs.go
!design-system/templates
!design-system/tokens
!design-system/fixtures
docs-site
prototypes
**/node_modules
*.md
!docs/guides/*.md
